                ),
              ),
            ),
            Padding(
              padding: const EdgeInsets.fromLTRB(20, 20, 20, 24),
              child: Column(
                crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
                children: [
                  const Padding(
                    padding: EdgeInsets.only(left: 4, bottom: 16),
                    child: Text(
                      'Que quieres hacer hoy?',
                      style: TextStyle(color: _textoSuave, fontSize: 15),
